  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Slice the onion and mushrooms, and mince the garlic.",
    "In a large pan, heat the olive oil over medium heat and saute the onion, mushrooms, and garlic until the vegetables are softened.",
    "Add the spinach to the pan and cook until wilted.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooked pasta, sauteed vegetables, and crumbled feta cheese.",
    "Season the mixture with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and roast in the preheated oven for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the casserole from the oven and let it cool for a few minutes before serving."
  ],
